I've left out both operations requests. This node's `with` clause grants only `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` needs filesystem authority the node doesn't have, and calling the metadata service needs `http-client` authority it doesn't have. The metadata request would also send each input's text to an external host. Those changes would need the node's grant widened, which is a decision for whoever owns the graph, not something the body can add on its own.

